  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">for strengthening data governance in Kenya and East Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant renews support to a collaboration between Amnesty International Kenya and the Open Institute in Kenya. The partnership advances data privacy and protection by empowering individuals and institutions to understand and safeguard personal data through policy advocacy; cross-border collaborations that work to strengthen data governance frameworks across East Africa; regional, national, and local-level awareness campaigns; and capacity-building workshops.</narrative>
  </description>
